"t": "Unless otherwise expressly stated in a separate written agreement executed by the Company, participation in the internship shall not be construed as creating an employment relationship, permanent employment relationship, employer-employee relationship, partnership, joint venture, agency relationship, fiduciary relationship, or similar relationship between the Company and the Intern."
